<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-092-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.429006" lon="-120.963464"><name>SC26-092-B</name><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 8.5 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 71/100; not catch probability. Center 80 ft; nearby 76–105 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-073</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.430412823855974" lon="-120.96403449611911"/><trkpt lat="35.43033014031838" lon="-120.9644771537865"/><trkpt lat="35.42997526598668" lon="-120.96481651764222"/><trkpt lat="35.42898404540536" lon="-120.96484146535789"/><trkpt lat="35.42879825430383" lon="-120.9645157157649"/><trkpt lat="35.42816747758578" lon="-120.96453159338091"/><trkpt lat="35.428276148532824" lon="-120.96563026955191"/><trkpt lat="35.42773362684717" lon="-120.96553377750875"/><trkpt lat="35.42772249168028" lon="-120.96487321523443"/><trkpt lat="35.427271936708465" lon="-120.96488455399795"/><trkpt lat="35.427275648770475" lon="-120.96510474015776"/><trkpt lat="35.42655476064067" lon="-120.9651228796965"/><trkpt lat="35.426551048676934" lon="-120.96490269549616"/><trkpt lat="35.42610049360932" lon="-120.96491403360545"/><trkpt lat="35.42591284661314" lon="-120.96447820392785"/><trkpt lat="35.42588127263829" lon="-120.96260665510911"/><trkpt lat="35.42605034366857" lon="-120.96194156737607"/><trkpt lat="35.42648602437924"